[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0245","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0269","title":"GNU Emacs 20 从属PTY设备权限设置不当导致本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"GNU Emacs 20 在启动子进程时未能正确设置从属 PTY 设备的权限，导致本地攻击者可利用该漏洞读取或修改 Emacs 与子进程之间的通信内容。该漏洞影响 Emacs 20 系列版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0269"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21Z","remediation":"建议升级到 GNU Emacs 20.7 或更高版本（如 Emacs 21.1 及以上），这些版本已修复 PTY 权限设置缺陷。若暂时无法升级，可通过设置 /dev/ptmx 权限为 600 或限制普通用户访问 PTY 设备作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至受支持的 Emacs 版本（如 28.x 或 29.x）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1125","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-04-15&msg=tg4s8zioxq.fsf%40mercury.rus.uni-stuttgart.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0269.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0269","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0269.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0269.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j2cr-8pw5-rpvq/GHSA-j2cr-8pw5-rpvq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0269.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6a1643ae-483e-40ad-b0a7-710021ff3bd4.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f9648a93cda37545740a15294a2d605e6f32fa20/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0069","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0083","title":"HP HP-UX asecure 音频安全文件权限设置不当漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 asecure 工具在创建音频安全配置文件 audio.sec 时，未正确设置文件权限，导致该文件权限配置不当。本地攻击者利用此漏洞可读取或修改 audio.sec 文件，造成拒绝服务或获取额外系统权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 系统，需拥有本地访问权限才能利用，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0083"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57Z","remediation":"立即为 HP-UX 系统安装 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX0002-109 中对应的 asecure 补丁。临时缓解措施：以 root 权限执行 `chmod 600 /etc/audio.sec` 限制音频安全文件仅 root 可读写，并移除不必要的 audio 子系统 SUID 权限 (`chmod -s /usr/sbin/asecure`)。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2031","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0083.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0083","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0083.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0083.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ab96f9177ee90a5f19d09110efe1f64b34e91053/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x6g9-pg8p-c822/GHSA-x6g9-pg8p-c822.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2001/CVE-2001-0607.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--831d058a-08bd-4084-93af-235f5a790eeb.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fb522a8b91ce9f7aefbdbbac6f22e68bc83ef631/2000/CVE-2000-0083.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0239","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0266","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.01 存在跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 Java 小程序，利用 JSObject 接口修改 DOM 属性，将 IFRAME 元素的 src 属性设置为任意 JavaScript URL，从而绕过浏览器的跨框架安全限制，可能导致受影响用户浏览器中的敏感信息泄露。攻击者需诱使用户访问包含恶意小程序的网页。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0266"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-04-18T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 至 5.5 或更高版本，或在浏览器安全设置中禁用 Java 小程序支持（工具 → Internet 选项 → 安全 → 自定义级别 → 禁用 Java 小程序脚本），以阻止恶意 applet 利用 JSObject 绕过跨域安全策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1121","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38FC6130.D6D178FD%40nat.bg"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0237","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0237.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0264","title":"Panda Security 3.0 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Panda Security 3.0 存在安全绕过漏洞。当软件禁用注册表编辑功能后，本地用户仍可通过直接执行 .reg 注册表文件或使用其他未授权方法绕过此限制，从而修改系统注册表并获取更高权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限，影响系统的完整性。Panda Security 3.0 用户受此漏洞影响。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0264"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-04-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21Z","remediation":"Panda Security 3.0 已停止技术支持，建议立即升级到受支持的 Panda Security 最新版本。如无法升级，可通过组策略或注册表禁用 .reg 文件的默认关联执行（将 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\.reg 的默认值改为 txtfile），并限制用户对注册表编辑器的访问权限（设置 HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Policies\\System 下 DisableRegistryTools=1），同时移除用户对注册表文件的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://updates.pandasoftware.com/docs/us/Avoidvulnerability.zip","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1119","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38FB45F2.550EA000%40teleline.es","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19855","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0264.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0264","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0264.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0264.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2322-3mhq-32v4/GHSA-2322-3mhq-32v4.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0264.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001294.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0237.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0237.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0238","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0265","title":"Panda Security 3.0 安全软件可被任意卸载漏洞","description":"Panda Security 3.0 存在安全配置缺陷，本地用户可通过 Windows 系统自带的「添加/删除程序」控制面板直接卸载该安全软件，无需管理员权限验证。攻击者在获得系统本地访问权限后，可利用此漏洞轻松移除防病毒防护，使目标系统暴露于恶意软件感染风险之下，为后续安装后门、木马等恶意程序创造有利条件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0265"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Panda Security 至 3.0 以上版本（如 Platinum 或 Global 版），这些版本在卸载时要求输入管理员密码。如无法升级，可通过组策略或注册表禁用普通用户的「添加/删除程序」权限，防止非授权卸载杀毒软件。同时开启 Windows 审核策略，监控 msiexec 卸载行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://updates.pandasoftware.com/docs/us/Avoidvulnerability.zip","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1119","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38FB45F2.550EA000%40teleline.es"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0281","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0281.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0291","title":"StarDivision StarOffice 5.1 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"StarOffice 5.1 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过在文档中嵌入超长URL触发缓冲区溢出，导致应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 StarOffice 5.1 版本，攻击条件为诱使用户打开包含恶意URL的特制文档，无法远程直接利用。建议用户避免打开来源不明的文档或升级到更高版本以规避风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0291"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24Z","remediation":"建议升级至 StarOffice 5.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复此缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 StarOffice 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache OpenOffice 或 LibreOffice 等持续更新的办公套件。临时缓解措施：避免打开来源不明的文档，尤其是包含超长 URL 链接的文档。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0077.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1112","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0291.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0291","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0291.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0291.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-585v-cj86-hmjj/GHSA-585v-cj86-hmjj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1112/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0291.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--45d319e2-ff59-43e0-b408-302876e9eced.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633bef0eb7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0281.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0273","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0285","title":"XFree86 X11R6 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"XFree86 3.3.x 的 -xkbmap 参数处理存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可向该参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而以目标系统当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 XFree86 3.3.x 系列版本，需本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响的 XFree86 版本或应用厂商提供的补丁进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0285"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 xkbmap 参数长度检查不足的问题。由于 XFree86 已停止维护，建议迁移至 X.Org Server（X11R7.x 系列）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许可信用户访问图形界面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0076.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1306","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0285.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0285","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0285.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0285.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-989m-9h73-8xcc/GHSA-989m-9h73-8xcc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0285.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001292.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f9648a93cda37545740a15294a2d605e6f32fa20/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0236","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0236.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0263","title":"Red Hat Linux 6.x X Font Server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.x 系统中的 X Font Server (xfs) 组件在处理畸形请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 xfs 服务发送特制的恶意请求触发该漏洞，导致 xfs 服务进程崩溃进而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0263"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21Z","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 7.x 或更高版本，或安装 Red Hat 官方提供的 xfs 补丁包。如无法升级，可停止 xfs 服务（`service xfs stop && chkconfig xfs off`）并在防火墙中禁用 TCP 端口 7100 以阻断外部访问。对于仍在使用 RHEL 6 的系统，建议迁移至受支持的 RHEL 7/8/9 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0079.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1111","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0263.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0263","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0263.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0263.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fjx2-c7c3-8w5j/GHSA-fjx2-c7c3-8w5j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1111/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0263.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--df86b5a3-4715-4230-9e82-a029e91666eb.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0236.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0254","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0286","title":"Linux X Font Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"X Font Server (xfs) 存在输入验证缺陷，本地攻击者可通过向 xfs 的 Unix socket 发送特制的畸形数据，触发缓冲区溢出或服务崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RedHat Linux 6.x 及早期 Linux 发行版，需要本地用户权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0286"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 xfs 软件包至修复版本（Red Hat Linux 6.x 用户安装 RHSA 更新或升级至 xfs 版本 1.3.1 以上），或禁用 xfs 服务（`chkconfig xfs off`；`service xfs stop`）。如无法升级，在 `/etc/X11/fs/config` 中限制 `no-listen = tcp` 仅允许本地 socket 访问，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0079.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1111","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19850"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0254.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0253","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0284","title":"华盛顿大学 IMAPD 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"华盛顿大学 IMAP 服务器（UW-IMAP）的 imapd 组件 4.7 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。具有有效账户的攻击者可通过向 IMAP 服务发送特制的 LIST 或其他命令触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 WU-IMAP 2000.287 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者需先拥有目标系统的有效账户方可利用，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0284"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 UW IMAPD 至 4.7 以上已修复版本（如 imap-2000.287 之后的版本），或在无法升级时限制受信用户访问 IMAP 服务，并在网络层限制对 IMAP 端口（143/tcp）的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0074.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0085.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1110","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19847"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19847"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-2168","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-2168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1218","title":"Microsoft Windows DNS 缓存投毒漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 98/NT 4.0/2000/XP 的域名解析器默认配置将 QueryIpMatching 参数设置为 0，导致系统会接受来自未查询主机的 DNS 更新响应，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送伪造的 DNS 响应数据包实施 DNS 缓存投毒攻击，将合法域名解析指向恶意 IP 地址，进而实现中间人攻击、钓鱼或恶意软件分发。该漏洞影响 Windows 98/NT 4.0/2000/XP 等广泛使用的操作系统版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1218"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-04-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24Z","remediation":"在受影响系统（Windows 98/NT 4.0/2000/XP）中，打开注册表编辑器，定位到 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters，新建 DWORD 值 QueryIpMatching 并设为 1，使 DNS 解析器仅接受来自已查询 DNS 服务器的响应，防止 DNS 缓存投毒。同时建议部署 DNSSEC 或 IPSec 对 DNS 流量进行加密验证，并在网络边界防火墙限制仅允许与可信 DNS 服务器通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/458659","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4280","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1218.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1218","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1218.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1218.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155d