554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0260.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0260","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0260.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0260.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/967.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/frontpage_dvwssr.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0260.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0806.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0806.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0229","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0254","title":"Dansie Shopping Cart 3.0.4 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Dansie Shopping Cart 3.0.4 的 cart.pl 脚本存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 env、db 或 vars 等表单变量发送特制 URL 请求，无需任何身份认证即可获取购物车数据库及系统配置信息，导致敏感数据泄露。该漏洞利用方式简单，影响范围较广，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0254"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Dansie Shopping Cart 至最新版本（3.0.5 或更高），在 Apache/IIS 的 Web 根目录中移除或重命名 cart.pl 文件；如不再使用该软件，应彻底卸载并删除所有相关 CGI 脚本。在无法升级时，在 Web 服务器层限制对 cart.pl 的访问，仅允许授权 IP 请求该脚本，并在 Perl 脚本入口处过滤 env/db/vars 等敏感参数输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1115","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4954","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19852","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0254.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0254","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0254.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0254.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v93j-3f23-p5mq/GHSA-v93j-3f23-p5mq.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/dansie_cart.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0254.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001287.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4c93c92e-6eca-4fb4-a659-77bb57267063.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0229.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0229.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0226","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0250","title":"QSSL QNX 4.25 crypt 函数弱加密本地权限提升漏洞","description":"QNX 4.25 A 的 crypt() 密码加密函数使用了弱加密算法，本地攻击者可通过分析加密后的密码哈希值，利用加密算法弱点进行解密还原明文密码，从而获得其他用户（包括 root）的登录凭证，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 QNX 4.25 A 版本，需要本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0250"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19Z","remediation":"建议升级至 QNX Neutrino 6.3 及以上版本，这些版本使用更强的 MD5 或 SHA 密码哈希算法替代原有的弱加密。如无法升级，可通过限制控制台/SSH 登录用户为受信任管理员，并启用系统审计日志监控 `/etc/shadow` 文件的异常读取行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0072.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1114","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19851","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0250.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0250","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0250.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0250.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p3hr-r8ch-hrrq/GHSA-p3hr-r8ch-hrrq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1114/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0250.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa774